        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Scott Kelly\n- People: a United States participant in Soyuz TMA-4\n- Projects: Soyuz TMA-4 expedition\n- Systems: Japanese Experiment Module (ISS)\n- Roles: commander\n\nFacts:\n- The Soyuz TMA-4 expedition included a United States participant.\n- The United States participant in the Soyuz TMA-4 expedition held a record of 381.6 days for the most time in space.\n- Scott Kelly broke the 381.6-day most-time-in-space record.\n- Scott Kelly was commander of the Japanese Experiment Module (ISS) on Expeditions 26, 45, and 46.",
